# JT-80x0's pages, as the screen shows them (theme PAPER): HOME, OSC 1 (Super Saw, DETUNE turned), OSC 2, FILTER
# (CUTOFF swept), the envelopes, LFO 1, TONE, MULTI-FX, PERFORM, with chords playing so the scopes move.
# Used for the screens in the "JP-8000 sound for under £50" video (22-23 Nov).
#   python3 tools/demo/demo.py tools/demo/screens.demo --keep    -> build/demo/screens/f-*.ppm, build/demo/screens.mp4

name   JT-80x0
theme  amber
0.2    press GLO
+0.05  press GLO
+0.05  press GLO
+0.05  press GLO
+0.05  press GLO
+0.05  press GLO
+0.1   turn KNOB1 6 0     # THEME PAPER (as Kris's FM-1)
+0.1   press HOME
+0.1   pc 41                # Pad 01: OSC 1 Super Saw
1.0   note C3,G3,D#4,A#4 3.8 100
5.0   note G#2,D#3,C4,G4 3.8 100
9.0   note A#2,F3,D4,A4 3.8 100
13.0   note G2,D3,A#3,F4 3.8 100
17.0   note C3,G3,D#4,A#4 3.8 100
21.0   note G#2,D#3,C4,G4 3.8 100
25.0   note A#2,F3,D4,A4 3.8 100
29.0   note G2,D3,A#3,F4 3.8 100
33.0   note C3,G3,D#4,A#4 3.8 100
37.0   note G#2,D#3,C4,G4 3.8 100
41.0   note A#2,F3,D4,A4 3.8 100
45.0   note G2,D3,A#3,F4 3.8 100
49.0   note C3,G3,D#4,A#4 3.8 100
53.0   note G#2,D#3,C4,G4 3.8 100
7.0    press EDIT           # OSC 1
8.0    turn KNOB2 40 3.0
11.5   turn KNOB2 -40 2.5
14.0   press EDIT           # the next EDIT page
19.0   press SEL            # FILTER 1/2
20.0   turn KNOB3 -60 3.0
23.2   turn KNOB3 60 2.6
26.0   press ENV
31.0   press ENV
36.0   press LFO
41.0   press FX
44.0   press FX
47.0   press GLO
+0.05  press GLO
+0.05  press GLO
51.0   press HOME
56.0   end
